# capture.py regenerates everything here from nifti_clib plus a C compiler,
# so `python3 capture.py` reproduces oracle.json and commands.sh byte for
# byte with no Rust toolchain and no libvips NIfTI support (there is none).
#
# fixtures/ IS pinned. nifti_clib is not a dependency of this crate and will
# not be on a CI machine, so a port has no way to produce these inputs for
# itself and needs them checked in. They are 104 tiny files, about 36K in
# total, and capture.py rewrites all of them on every run.
#
# outputs/ is pure scratch: the compiled probe binary and the intermediate
# datasets nifti_tool writes with -prefix.
outputs/
__pycache__/
